Stop the PNS and intensity walk on an inconsistent group table.

After a corrupt frame, the window group table (group[]) could fail to
advance or run past the windows; pns_intensity_right.cpp then read past
mask[] and into the decoder state. The walk stops when a group end does
not advance or exceeds num_win.

Regression input: tools/aacdec-fuzz/regressions/t169-pns-groups.bin.

